        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Sooke Philharmonic Orchestra David Stewart, Conductor   Annual free open air pops concert by the sea.   Sooke Philharmonic Fling! returns to Ed Macgregor Park&nbsp;Sunday July 5 at 2:30 p.m. conducted by David Stewart.   As always there will be a 50/50 draw and when you donate at admission there"
